    <description>DIR-1258: New Submission approval process for a Residential Payment Plan Product2 record (first-time submission or resubmission after rejection). 2-level chain: PDC (DevCo) -&gt; CFO. Self-triggers off RES_Payment_Plan_Submission_Requested__c flipping true on a record whose prior RES_Approval_Status__c was NOT Approved (an already-approved plan being modified is handled by RES_Payment_Plan_Modification_Approval_Process instead).</description>
